@startuml EventBus_Outbox_Integration
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

box "Module A (Nguồn - MidtermProgress)" #E8F5E9
participant "Command Handler" as HandlerA
participant "Aggregate Root" as DomainA
database "midterm_progress\n.OutboxMessages" as OutboxA
end box

box "Hạ tầng Event Bus" #FFF8E1
participant "Outbox Processor\n(Background Worker)" as Worker
queue "In-Memory Event Bus\n(MediatR / Channels)" as Bus
end box

box "Module B (Đích - Notifications)" #E1F5FE
participant "Integration Event\nHandler" as HandlerB
database "notifications\n.InboxMessages" as InboxB
participant "Email Service" as EmailService
end box

== 1. Phát sinh sự kiện & Ghi vào Outbox ==
HandlerA -> DomainA: Xử lý nghiệp vụ dừng đề tài
DomainA -> DomainA: Raise Domain Event:\nThesisStoppedDomainEvent
DomainA --> HandlerA: OK
HandlerA -> OutboxA: Lưu Integration Event:\nThesisStoppedIntegrationEvent\n(Cùng 1 Database Transaction)
HandlerA -->: Hoàn tất Command

== 2. Quét Outbox & Đẩy lên Event Bus ==
loop Định kỳ mỗi 2 giây
    Worker -> OutboxA: SELECT TOP 20 * WHERE ProcessedDate IS NULL
    OutboxA --> Worker: Danh sách Events
    Worker -> Bus: Publish(ThesisStoppedIntegrationEvent)
    Worker -> OutboxA: UPDATE OutboxMessages SET ProcessedDate = GETUTCDATE()
end

== 3. Nhận sự kiện & Xử lý tại Module B ==
Bus -> HandlerB: Dispatch Event tới Subscriber
HandlerB -> InboxB: Kiểm tra xem EventId đã xử lý chưa (Idempotency)
alt Chưa xử lý
    HandlerB -> InboxB: INSERT InboxMessages(EventId, GETUTCDATE())
    HandlerB -> EmailService: Gửi email cảnh báo dừng KLTN tới Sinh viên
    EmailService --> HandlerB: Sent OK
else Đã xử lý rồi
    HandlerB -> HandlerB: Bỏ qua (Tránh gửi email trùng lặp)
end

@enduml
